# Bias-corrected TerraClimate runoff depth for the Yangtze River Basin

This repository provides monthly bias-corrected TerraClimate runoff depth
for the Yangtze River Basin upstream of Datong from 2007 to 2024.

- GeoTIFF rasters are available under Releases, version v1.0.0.
  Each yearly file contains 12 monthly bands from January to December.
- Accompanying CSV tables are available in the `csv/` folder.
